Let me guess.  As per many primitive superstitions,
whenever you take a picture of something you steal its soul?

I'd think you'd run into major problems with Vlad and Medusa, though.
For one thing, just as vampires don't cast a reflection, I don't
think they photgraph well either.  With the Medusa, you probably
can't focus the camera well enough and get the right angle without
having your eyes open.... urk.

I can't imagine what sort of Quest Nemesis you'd have for a
Journalism Quest.  Instead of the usual intimidations and insults
that most nemeses have, I'd think you'd find yourself stuck with
a whole lot of things of the form of:
  "No Comment"
  "I can neither affirm nor deny that"
  "What was your name again?"

